    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A cold-sleep management puzzle action game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the artificial intelligence called Freezia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring peace and order to humankind by putting them into cold sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is your job as Freezia to stabilize the temperature of the cold sleep pods within the time limit. Adjust the temperature in a timely manner and finish your duties promptly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be attentive when maintaining the temperature. If freezing accidents occur frequently, it may put you in danger as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanying you are an oracle proselytizing artificial intelligence and a cheerful crew to put into hibernation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like an ice-cold star shining down on a closed-off world, observe as the curtain falls on the future of humankind.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A cold-sleep management puzzle action game.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the artificial intelligence called Freezia.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bring peace and order to humankind by putting them into cold sleep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is your job as Freezia to stabilize the temperature of the cold sleep pods within the time limit. Adjust the temperature in a timely manner and finish your duties promptly. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be attentive when maintaining the temperature. If freezing accidents occur frequently, it may put you in danger as well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accompanying you are an oracle proselytizing artificial intelligence and a cheerful crew to put into hibernation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like an ice-cold star shining down on a closed-off world, observe as the curtain falls on the future of humankind.</p>",
